   Tantivy Query: {"boolean":{"must":[{"with_index":{"query":{"all":{"field":"id"}}}},{"postgres_expression":{"expr":{"expr_desc":"paradedb.term_with_operator('rating'::paradedb.fieldname, '='::text, $1)"}}}]}}
     Applies to Aggregates: COUNT(*), SUM(amount)
     Group By: region
     Aggregate Definition: {"grouped":{"aggs":{"0":{"sum":{"field":"amount","missing":null,"none_if_no_match":true}}},"terms":{"field":"region","order":{"_key":"asc"},"segment_size":65000,"size":65000}}}
